WEBVTT

00:13:30.372 --> 00:13:33.063
Today, I am doing quite well.

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:37.061
The immunotherapy drugs
appear to be working,

00:13:37.085 --> 00:13:39.846
and we are watching
and waiting with scans.

00:13:40.709 --> 00:13:42.906
I hope I will live a long time.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:48.224
I hope I will live long enough
to embarrass my son

00:13:48.248 --> 00:13:51.192
and to watch my husband
lose his beautiful hair.

00:13:52.027 --> 00:13:53.476
And I think I might.

00:13:54.161 --> 00:13:56.310
But I am learning to live

00:13:56.334 --> 00:13:58.121
and to love

00:13:58.145 --> 00:14:00.363
without counting the cost,